<div id="variable-importance-and-expected-value-of-perfect-information" class="section level2">
<h2>Variable importance and Expected Value of Perfect Information</h2>
<p>We use variable in projection (VIP) to show important variables in
the model and value of information is visualized using the expected
value of perfect information (EVPI).</p>
<pre class="r"><code>pls_result &lt;- plsr.mcSimulation(object = mcSimulation_results,
