<div id="monte-carlo-simulation-with-scenarios" class="section level1">
<h1>Monte Carlo simulation with scenarios</h1>
<p>Based on two most critical variables in Figure 2 — maize and lease
prices — we built scenarios showing how the decision changes as those
prices vary.</p>
<p>Requirements: price bounds for both maize and lease prices.</p>
<p>For maize-price bounds we obtained data from daily submissions to the
Ministry of Agriculture (<a href="https://amis.co.ke/site/market" class="uri">https://amis.co.ke/site/market</a>). We used national level
data and for Murang’a County that was available (2005–2024).</p>
<pre class="r"><code># Read every maize-price CSV from the folder and clean the price columns.
maize_files &lt;- list.files(&quot;maize_prices/&quot;, pattern = &quot;\\.csv$&quot;, full.names = TRUE)

